# Deliberately near-empty. This repo builds two Apple targets under two
# different bundle ids (works.rainn.sigil for iOS, works.rainn.sigil.mac for
# macOS). As of #52 both sign under the same Rainnworks Developer team
# (53W966FBFP), but a single global app_identifier here would still be wrong
# for one of them, so each lane in Fastfile sets its own bundle id and team id
# explicitly instead.
